# PROJECT 2: SMART STUDENT & BANKING MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
# ==============================================================================
# This project merges and elevates all error handling concepts from 'errorfinding.py':
#  1. ValueError & General Exception (Student Registration & Integer input)
#  2. Custom Exception Raising (Age eligibility check: age < 18)
#  3. Custom ValueError Raising (Password validation: length < 6)
